    pr:source <http://example.org/sen0401/engine/paper#midterm_v1_src22> ;
    pr:stem "The program reads five sequence values. A value signals opt-in replacement when it is below 0xfffffffe, and it carries a relative timelock when bit 31 is clear. The program adds up the low 16 bits of the values that do both. What does it print?" .

