    pr:source <http://example.org/sen0401/engine/paper#midterm_v1_src7> ;
    pr:stem "A wallet spends one coin of 200,000 satoshis to pay 120,000 satoshis to a payee; everything else returns to the wallet as change. The finished transaction weighs 1,126 weight units and the wallet pays a fee rate of 18 satoshis per virtual byte. How many satoshis does the change output hold?" ;
