    pr:stem "A node reads the configuration file and is started with the command line shown. What happens?" .

<http://example.org/sen0401/engine/paper#midterm_v1_item9_optA> pr:isKey false ;
    pr:letter "A" ;
    pr:text "It starts with pruning and the transaction index both on, because the refusal applies only to options given on the command line." .

