    pr:letter "C" ;
    pr:text "It starts with pruning at 550, no transaction index and a cache of 2048: the command line overrides the file, and that removes the conflict." .

<http://example.org/sen0401/engine/paper#midterm_v1_item9_optD> pr:isKey false ;
    pr:letter "D" ;
    pr:text "It refuses to start: the file asks for pruning and the transaction index together, and the file is applied after the command line." .

